<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sonus a strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sonus a strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Hambrecht &amp; Quist raised its recommendation on Sonus Pharmaceuticals to strong buy on news of a $3.0 million milestone payment from Japan's Daiichi Pharmaceutical Co Ltd.</p>
<p>--said despite news that Guerbet SA will not exercise its option to market EchoGen Emulsion in Europe H&amp;Q is confident Sonus can find a new European partner.</p>
</text>
